<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank market closed.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank market closed.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian pound private sector market was closed on Tuesday for a one-day national holiday.</p>
<p>Overnight rates narrowed on Monday in a moderately liquid market to 10-1/8 percent from Sunday's range of 10-1/8 and 10-7/16 percent.</p>
<p>One week rates also narrowed to 10-1/8 from between 10-1/8 and 10-3/8 percent on Sunday.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10-1/2 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
